        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "0baf4a4c-881c-5fae-8ed0-7356b8eba8a2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Flipper (1996 film), Flipper (1963 film), Deep Impact\n- Television: Flipper TV series, Home Improvement\n- People: Elijah Wood, Paul Hogan, Jessica Wesson, Zachery Ty Bryan, Peter Jackson, Mimi Leder, Bruce Joel Rubin, Michael Tolkin, Robert Duvall, Téa Leoni, Vanessa Redgrave, Maximilian Schell, Morgan Freeman\n- Roles: Frodo Baggins, Jennifer Sudarsky\n\nFacts:\n- The 1963 film Flipper led to a Flipper television series that ran from 1964 to 1967.\n- Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film Flipper.\n- The 1996 film Flipper stars Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\n- In the 1990s, Jessica Wesson had supporting roles in the Universal films Casper and Flipper.\n- On the sitcom Home Improvement, Jessica Wesson had a recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, who was Brad's first girlfriend, and Brad was played by Zachery Ty Bryan.\n- Elijah Wood is best known for playing Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's The Lord of the Rings film trilogy from 2001 to 2003.\n- Deep Impact is a 1998 American science fiction disaster film directed by Mimi Leder and written by Bruce Joel Rubin and Michael Tolkin.\n- Deep Impact stars Robert Duvall, Téa Leoni, Elijah Wood, Vanessa Redgrave, Maximilian Schell, and Morgan Freeman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
